All sequences with duplicated information and/or missing values were removed. All HemoPI model and validation datasets were normalised as XHemoPI values using Eq. (1). Testing datasets APD, HAMP and RPS datasets were normalised as Xtest|HemoPI values relative to the model dataset in use for predictions with Eq. (2). Values x, xmin and xmax belong to the model dataset such as HemoPI-1 and, xAPD belongs to the testing set, e.g. APD.1\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
