To evaluate the performances of all classifiers, we used the following assessment measures: accuracy (Acc.) (Eq. (3)), precision (Prec.) or positive predictive value (PPV) (Eq. (4)), Matthews correlation coefficient (MCC) (Eq. (5)), Cohen’s Kappa statistic (CK or κ) (Eq. (6)) and area under the curve Receiver Operating Characteristic (AUC-ROC) value (see Tables 1, 2, 3 and Tables S1a–S5).3\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
